: 1523294, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwndq.jpg"}, {"id": 1523295, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwndr.jpg"}, {"id": 1523296, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwnds.jpg"}, {"id": 1523298, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwndu.jpg"}, {"id": 1523300, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwndw.jpg"}], "slug": "evenicle-2", "storyline": "In a world where human civilization is constantly threatened by wild monsters, only the rare few individuals who wield forbidden skills dare challenge them. However, these brave warriors have to face an even more dangerous hazard... because with every Skill they use, a terrible curse eats away at their bodies.\n\nThe Hero Syndrome: a mysterious power that causes humans to catch random diseases with every skill they use in combat.\n\nOnly Alex - a young doctor wielding the forgotten healing Skill known as \"Medica\" - can hope to cure all the weird diseases ravaging the world. His unique power lets him administer a miraculous drug synthesized by his body... through the seminal fluid contained in the incredible \"syringe\" between his legs!", "summary": "There is an illness spreading through the world called the \u2018hero disease\u2019 where using magic will result in early death. People skilled in combat fought with monsters aware of their shortening lifespan. They fought to eliminate as many monsters as possible to protect their families and friends.\n\nIn this tragic world appeared a young man, Alex, who was blessed with a legendary healing ability. His body fluids can cure any ailment without physical trauma. He set out to save the girls suffering from the \u2018hero disease\u2019.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}, {"id": 42, "name": "Erotic"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/evenicle-2", "videos": [{"id": 33260, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Jx7kll-oSms", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jx7kll-oSms", "title": "\u30a4\u30d6\u30cb\u30af\u30eb\uff12\u3000\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Jx7kll-oSms/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 148941, "name": "English Trailer", "video_id": "xOM7CgJU5D8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xOM7CgJU5D8", "title": "Evenicle 2 - Intro", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xOM7CgJU5D8/sddefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 5996, "name": "Evenicle"}]}